────────────────────
_ do resize-buffer'Item CPointer'Item without gc
    - source CPointer'Item
    - size Size
    - new-size Size

. replacement = allocate'Item(new-size)
. copy-size = size
if new-size < copy-size
    copy-size = new-size
C:yumiArrayCopySlice(replacement, source, copy-size * Item.size)
= replacement

